# Kytheon, Hero of Akros: "At end of combat, if Kytheon and at least two other creatures attacked this combat, exile Kytheon,
# then return him to the battlefield transformed under his owner's control" (CR 511.2, 603.4, 712.14a). Kytheon and two
# Ornithopters attack on turn 3; Bot2 Bolts one of the Ornithopters while it attacks, and it still counts - it attacked (the
# ruling). Kytheon returns as Gideon, Battle-Forged, a new object with his 3 loyalty (CR 306.5b), and Gideon's +2 with no
# target (up to one) raises it to 5. Bot2 took Kytheon's 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Kytheon, Hero of Akros
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x13

